  "commit_message": "Add paired PID cleanup for breadcrumb monitor timeouts (#2848)\n\nIntroduce an opt-in --paired-pid-file monitor argument plus LARCH_PAIRED_PID_FILE writer support for top-level Family B scripts. On monitor timeout, validate the PID file, send TERM, wait briefly, then send KILL while preserving exit 4 on all kill failures. Update top-level callsites, nested-child env unsets, foreground-marker lint enforcement, tests, and the security/docs contract.\n\nAudit design-log-publish.sh against larch-log.sh/lib-larch-log.sh and leave the already-shared breadcrumb publish helper unchanged.",
